<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amgen downgraded by Vector.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amgen downgraded by Vector.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Securities analyst Barbara Dau Hoffman said she downgraded Amgen Inc to attractive from buy.</p>
<p>Shares in the biotechnology company were off 1-3/4 to 66-5/8.</p>
<p>&quot;Given the shares' recent run-up, there is a high degree of likelihood of a correction,&quot; Hoffman said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
